<title>USA: 3-D Geophysical sets shareholder rights.</title>
<headline>3-D Geophysical sets shareholder rights.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLETON, Colo. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>In a move to protect its shareholders and itself from a hostile takeover bid, 3-D Geophysical said Friday that it now has in place a shareholder rights plan in place. The company, a maker of land-based seismic data acquisition services, said the rights plan was not adopted in response to any specific offer to acquire control of the company.</p>
</text>
